<title>POLAND: Polish NBP buys marks at PLN 1.8190 -dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP buys marks at PLN 1.8190 -dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) bought marks on the interbank market at 1.8190 zlotys, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention, described as &quot;medium&quot;, came at 0925 GMT when the zloty was at 2.73 percent from the mark parity rate for today -- the centre of the daily 14-percent trading band.</p>
<p>Earlier on Thursday the NBP also bought dollars between 3.1405 and 3.1233 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
